sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant V as ServeVerb
  participant L as Ledger
  participant R as SessionRunner
  participant C as claude
  Note over V,C: serve stops while X prepares, Y runs here, and Z runs on a runner
  V->>L: serve-stopping
  L-->>L: stopping is set, and start is a no-op from here
  V->>R: cut the deadlines, kill the local processes, wait 10 s
  R--xC: kill Y
  R->>L: prepare-failed(X, serve stopping), exited(Y, killed)
  Note over L: X and Y stay running in the ledger, and Z keeps running on its runner
  Note over V,C: serve starts
  V->>L: replay the unfinished effects
  V->>L: serve-started to every item that has not ended
  L-->>L: X and Y go to interrupted with retry now, and Z stays running with effect adopt
  L->>R: prepare(X) afresh, launch(Y, resume), adopt(Z)
  R->>C: claude --resume for Y, claude -p for X
